%% Luồng yêu cầu phụ tùng & xuất kho

sequenceDiagram
  participant NV as Staff
  participant API as Backend
  participant AD as Admin
  participant DB as PostgreSQL/parts

  NV->>API: POST parts-requests (repairOrderId, lines[])
  Note over API: status PENDING

  AD->>API: GET .../pending
  AD->>API: POST .../approve
  Note over API: APPROVED

  AD->>API: POST .../fulfill
  API->>DB: Kiểm tra quantity_on_hand mỗi part
  alt Đủ hàng
    API->>DB: Trừ kho + quantityIssued
    Note over API: FULFILLED
  else Thiếu hàng
    API-->>AD: lỗi thiếu tồn
  end
